        <mxCell id="35" value="Field                              Size (bytes)&#xa;────────────────────────────────────────────&#xa;Ethernet Header (Dst MAC+Src MAC+EtherType)  14&#xa;IP Header                                    20&#xa;ICMP Header                                   8&#xa;  ↳  Type (1) + Code (1) + Checksum (2)&#xa;  ↳  Identifier (2) + Sequence (2)&#xa;ICMP Data Payload                            32&#xa;Ethernet FCS (footer)                         4&#xa;────────────────────────────────────────────&#xa;Total Frame Size                             78 bytes" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#036897;fillColor=#dae8fc;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=pre;rounded=4;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=5;spacingBottom=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
